  "prefLabel": "Odb 402.05 Compliance",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Odb 402.05 “Compliance” means conformance with applicable local, state, and federal facility operating requirements, including the department guidance document titled, “Best Management Practices for the Installation and Upgrading of On-Premises-Use Heating Oil Tanks” (2008 edition).\n\nSource. #12942, eff 12-15-19",
